      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Intravenous Artesunate is a treatment that is suggested to be followed by Intravenous Vitamin C for breast cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f0633d0c9fbeab3f25914885985ace04</data>
      <data key="d4">Breast Cancer Example ER .pdf</data>
