    <node id="Melatonin">
      <data key="d0">Melatonin</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Melatonin is a hormone that benefits breast cancer patients, particularly those with ER+ breast cancer, by decreasing the production of estrogen receptors.&lt;SEP&gt;Melatonin is a hormone that can regulate hormone levels and may influence drug resistance in cancer treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Melatonin is a hormone that regulates sleep-wake cycles and has been studied for its potential anti-cancer properties.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f0633d0c9fbeab3f25914885985ace04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2405fce9bf1e9596eff6dd81273a458&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c8a13a1d7994bb3d188bcbdc68feefa</data>
