      <data key="d2">Reishi Mushrooms are fungi that suppress cell adhesion and metastasis in breast cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Reishi mushrooms are a type of medicinal fungus known for their potential health benefits, including suppression of cell adhesion and metastases in breast cancer.</data>
