      <data key="d3">chunk-f0633d0c9fbeab3f25914885985ace04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b81d9e841623e400ca410d21b5046cb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c8a13a1d7994bb3d188bcbdc68feefa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea5b318e2a8248e37e47eace395c05b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0049dde5f6453f5037ca54e07e32cce4</data>
      <data key="d2">Breast cancer is a disease that can metastasize to other areas such as the brain and is monitored through MRI scans.&lt;SEP&gt;Pomegranates act as natural aromatase inhibitors and inhibit growth factors in breast cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Breast cancer is a type of cancer that develops from breast tissue and is characterized by the production of aromatase and other genetic factors influencing its progression and treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Breast cancer is a disease where malignant cells form in the tissues of the breast, and it can exhibit various biological behaviors, including brain metastases.&lt;SEP&gt;Breast cancer is a type of cancer that originates from breast tissue and can metastasize to other parts of the body.</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
